<title>UK: CU up after 23 percent rise in new business.</title>
<headline>CU up after 23 percent rise in new business.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Commercial Union Plc rose in early trading on Wednesday after the insurance group posted a sharp rise in worldwide new business in the first nine months of 1996.</p>
<p>The stock was up 5-1/2p at 651-1/2 by 0724 GMT.</p>
